<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-TEAMS FOR RUSSIA V LUXEMBOURG WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TEAMS FOR RUSSIA V LUXEMBOURG WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for World Cup group five</p>
<p>qualifier between Russia and Luxembourg on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Russia - 1-Sergei Ovchinnikov; 2-Vladislav Radimov, 3-Yuri</p>
<p>Kovtun, 5-Omari Tetradze, 4-Alexei Kosolapov, 6-Igor Chugaynov,</p>
<p>7-Viktor Onopko, 10-Valery Kechinov, 8-Dmitry Alenichev, 11-Igor</p>
<p>Simutenkov, 9-Vladimir Beschastnykh</p>
<p>Luxembourg - 1-Paul Koch; 2-Jean Vanek, 3-Patrick Posing,</p>
<p>4-Marc Birsens, 8-Carlo Weis, 5-Jeff Strasser, 11-Frank Deville,</p>
<p>7-Guy Hellers, 10-Manual Cardoni, 6-Jeff Saibene, 9-Roby</p>
<p>Langers.</p>
</text>
